+-------
+
+**NgenicVelocityTransferFile**  `none`
+
+Optional two-column table used only by N-GenIC. The columns are `k [h/Mpc]`
+and a positive multiplicative correction to the scale-independent growing-mode
+velocity. DarkMatterSim uses this for run-matched CLASS thermal-WDM transfer
+responses, `f_particle(k)/f_GADGET(a)`, while preserving the N-GenIC density
+displacement and Fourier phases. The table must cover the fundamental mode
+through the largest three-dimensional particle-mesh wavenumber. Leave it as
+`none` when no scale-dependent first-order correction is required.
 
